parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/product\/lepique-retinol-night-cream\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Glass Skin 14Days Miracle Retinol Night Cream Anti-Wrinkle and Anti-Elasticity Cream Giving the Appearance of Glass Skin<\/p>","description":"<p class=\"a-size-base-plus a-text-bold\"><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">ULTIMATE ANTI-AGING FORMULA: Our night cream combines Retinol, Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, Centella to diminish the signs of aging, making it the best instant face tightener cream.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">BEGINNER&#8217;S GENTLE RETINOL TREATMENT: Beginners&#8217; amount &#8211; Retinol 0.1% with soothing centella keeps skin moisturized and revitalized while minimizing irritation, swelling, and rashes.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">PROVEN PERFORMANCE, GLOBALLY LOVED: A globally trending night cream with over 100 million views across TikTok and social platforms, recognized for its visible firming and overnight skin-renewing results.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">OVERNIGHT HYDRATION AND FIRMING: This advanced face and neck firming cream hydrates and firms while you sleep, delivering effective results across multiple areas for comprehensive care.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">SAFE FOR SENSITIVE SKIN: Our face lotion is formulated with non-toxic, non-irritant ingredients, our night cream is free of harsh chemicals, making it safe and suitable for all skin types.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">RETINOL TIP: Retinol works by actively accelerating skin renewal, so a mild tingling or warming sensation may be experienced, especially during the early stages of use. This is a normal response as the skin adjusts. To build tolerance comfortably, start by applying it once every three days, then progress to every other night, and eventually to daily use. Pure retinol can react on contact with the air, turning yellow. This is natural and does not impair its tolerance or efficacy.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Made in Korea<\/p>\n<p><strong>How to Use<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apply as the final step of your nighttime skincare routine.<\/li>\n<li>Take an appropriate amount and gently spread across the face, avoiding the eye area.<\/li>\n<li>Use sunscreen during the daytime when using retinol-based products.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Size:<\/strong> 50ml<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"145","regular_price":"189","sale_price":"145","price_range":null,"currency_code":"AED","currency_symbol":"AED","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"AED","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">AED<\/span>189<\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Original price was: AED189.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">AED<\/span>145<\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Current price is: AED145.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":31098,"src":"https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Lepique-Retinol-Night-Cream.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Lepique-Retinol-Night-Cream-400x400.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Lepique-Retinol-Night-Cream.webp 1000w, https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Lepique-Retinol-Night-Cream-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/kbeautybliss.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Lepique-Retinol-Night-Cream-150x150.w