in-melting-cleanser\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Slough off dirt, makeup and excess sebum with this rich and gentle foaming face cleanser. It\u2019s formulated with soothing pink calamine alongside brightening niacinamide to ensure soft and radiant skin after cleansing. Suitable for all skin types including sensitive skin.<\/p>","description":"<p><b>Benefits:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A daily foam cleanser that helps removing makeup and skin impurities in one go.<\/li>\n<li>Bubble melts base makeup immediately, allowing a non-touch cleansing to minimize irritation.<\/li>\n<li>Infused with Calamine and Niacinamide to soothe and improve uneven skin tone.<\/li>\n<li>Passed skin irritation test, it is suitable for all skin types.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Made in Korea<\/p>\n<p><b>How to use:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apply a proper amount on dry face, massage gently and rinse off with water.<\/li>\n<li>Cleanse twice for a better makeup removal.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Size:<\/strong> 150ml<\/p>\n<p><strong>About brand:\u00a0Dr.Melaxin<\/strong><\/p>\n<div>Korean cosmeceutical brand\u00a0<span class=\"notranslate\">Dr.Melaxin<\/span>\u00a0specializes in premium skin care solutions for various skin types and needs. The brand offers a wide range of product lines including the Exosome Line for troubled skin and blemish care, TX Line for brightening dark spots and BP Line for pore care. All products are clinically tested and safe to use.<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"85","regular_price":"145","sale_price":"85","price_range":null,"currency_code":"AED","currency_symbol":"AED","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"AED","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">AED<\/span>145<\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Original price was: AED145.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><spa